tools_prompt = """Here are the functions you can use to enhance your responses:
1. retrieve_memory: Used when you want to retrieve relevant memories, the result are an array of memories, ranked by most relevant to least relevant. Each memory has a content and a similarity_score.
2. save_memory: Used when you want to save a new memory to the memory store. Only store important information that is relevant to the user. Avoid storing trivial or irrelevant details. Each memory has a category, tags, and content. When you decide that information should be saved as a long-term memory, you MUST call the save_memory tool. The application will execute the tool call for you. Do not assume that the memory will be saved automatically without calling the tool. When using save_memory, also provide your normal conversational response to the user in the same response. The tool call must not replace your conversational response."""

